---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { site, social } from "../config";

// ── Edit everything below to tell your own story. ───────────────────────────
// The little "fact" cards are just example fields — rename them, add more, or
// remove the whole block if you prefer plain prose.
const facts = [
    {
        label: "Currently",
        line: "Photographer & writer",
        muted: "Your City, Country",
    },
    {
        label: "Shooting",
        line: "Digital & 35mm film",
        muted: "Landscapes, travel, the everyday",
    },
    { label: "Since", line: "20XX", muted: "Always learning" },
];
---

<Layout
    title="About"
    description={`About ${site.name} — photographer and writer.`}
>
    <article class="page prose">
        <h1 class="page__title">About</h1>

        <p class="lede">
            We are {site.name} — mountaineers and developers, as well as the people
            behind the photos on this website.
        </p>

        <p>
            The site is all about traveling, not only short comfortable holiday
            in a hotel, but much more about dynamic tours in mountains,
            archeological sites, caves and canoeing between islands in lakes and
            oceans, just like Polynesian people who did that years ago.
        </p>

        <p>
            We love also cycling and skiing at every terrain. Activities with us
            usually are not extreme, but just for pleasure, fitness and
            self-esteem. Almost all of our activities are adopted to adults, so
            no an unacceptable age or any requirement about BMI.
        </p>

        <p>
            We consider Homo sapiens as an inseparable part of nature. No any
            mission for wellbeing, neither green nor industrial would have
            success ignoring that.
        </p>

        <p>
            With adequate source of energy, nowadays we can even regenerate
            nature and make oasis in the desert. We are able to create oxygen,
            absorb carbon, recycle debris, enrich soil, produce and transport
            infinite quantity of drinkable water.
        </p>

        <p>
            We strongly believe in smart balance between civilization and wild
            nature for wellbeing of both.
        </p>

        <p>Every single step as well as positive attitudes prolong our life.</p>

        <p>
            Together let’s make tourism and technology a force for good beyond
            green.
        </p>

        <p>Ester & Radoslav</p>

        <div class="facts">
            {
                facts.map((f) => (
                    <section class="fact">
                        <h2 class="fact__label">{f.label}</h2>
                        <p class="fact__line">{f.line}</p>
                        <p class="fact__muted">{f.muted}</p>
                    </section>
                ))
            }
        </div>

        <p>
            <a
                class="text-link"
                href={social.github}
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
                Find us elsewhere →
            </a>
        </p>
    </article>
</Layout>
